      implies your agreement to the updated Terms.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Definitions</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>"Service"</strong> refers to the DodoRouter LLM proxy and routing platform.</li>
      <li><strong>"Model Provider"</strong> refers to entities developing or providing AI models (such as Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, Moonshot, Zhipu AI).</li>
      <li><strong>"User", "You"</strong> refers to anyone accessing or using the Service.</li>
      <li><strong>"We", "Us", "Company"</strong> refers to Foxwise AI FZ-LLC.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Description of Service</h2>
    <p>DodoRouter provides an LLM proxy and routing infrastructure featuring:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>API proxying with automatic failover and routing chains</li>
      <li>Request logging, analytics, and monitoring</li>
      <li>Credential management for multiple LLM providers</li>
      <li>OpenAI-compatible API endpoints</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. API Access & Credential Management</h2>
    <p>
      The Service may store and relay API credentials for third-party Model Providers on your behalf.
