    <ul>
      <li>Direct competitors of Foxwise AI FZ-LLC</li>
      <li>Employees, contractors, or agents of Model Providers accessing the Service for competitive intelligence, benchmarking, or investigative purposes</li>
      <li>Any person or entity engaged in benchmarking, mystery shopping, reverse engineering, or unauthorized investigation of the Service</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Violation of these restrictions constitutes a material breach and will result in immediate
